; Random number from 0 to A
;
; Takes the absolute value of the signed random number of #R$9CA8, so the result
; is between 0 and A (small values are likelier than large ones).
;
; A Largest value wanted
; DE Any value (#R$9CA8 adds it to the ROM address it reads)
; O:A Random number 0 to A
@label=RandomUpTo
c$9C9F CALL $9CA8
 $9CA2 BIT 7,A
 $9CA4 RET Z
 $9CA5 NEG
 $9CA7 RET
